

What we’re going to build is production like messaging queue 

Azure Queue Storage is designed specifically for this producer/consumer decoupling pattern

                 YOUR MAC
        ┌──────────────────────┐
        │                      │
        │  producer.py         │
        │      │               │
        │      │ send          │
        │      ▼               │
        │  Azure Queue         │
        │      │               │
        │      │ receive       │
        │      ▼               │
        │  consumer.py         │
        │      │               │
        │      │ process OK    │
        │      ▼               │
        │    DELETE            │
        │                      │
        └──────────────────────┘
        
We’ll eventually move consumer.py to your Azure VM:


Mac
 │
 │ producer
 ▼
Azure Queue
 │
 │ consumer
 ▼
Azure VM
